---
layout: hub-page.njk
permalink: /guides/index.html
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
title: "Exam prep and guides"
pageTitle: "Free Claude and Google Cloud Exam Guides | Harisankar Sivankutty"
description: "Free certification prep: study guides and practice questions for the Claude exams (CCAR-F, CCAR-P, CCDV-F) and Google Cloud Professional Cloud Architect, with data engineering and Databricks guides on the way."
---
{#- Exam prep library, after charliehills.ai's library pages: one compact,
    filterable grid instead of a shelf per vendor, so every guide fits on
    about one screen. Live exams come from exams.json (guide stats from
    bbLiveGuides, packs from brainbyte.practice); guides still being written
    are brainbyte.tracks without a live guide. Filter chips are plain links
    with data-gl-filter (guides.js); without JS every card shows. -#}
{%- set liveTrackSlugs = [] -%}
{%- for g in bbLiveGuides %}{% set liveTrackSlugs = (liveTrackSlugs.push(g.track), liveTrackSlugs) %}{% endfor -%}
{%- set vendors = [] %}{% for e in exams %}{% if (e.vendor or "Claude") not in vendors %}{% set vendors = (vendors.push(e.vendor or "Claude"), vendors) %}{% endif %}{% endfor -%}
{%- set coming = [] %}{% for t in brainbyte.tracks %}{% if t.slug not in liveTrackSlugs %}{% set coming = (coming.push(t), coming) %}{% endif %}{% endfor -%}

<header class="gl-head" id="hero">
  <p class="hub-label">Free · {{ site.newsletter.name }}</p>
  <h1 class="hub-h2">Exam prep and <span class="hub-accent">guides</span></h1>
  <p class="hub-sub">A study guide that shows how each exam thinks, plus practice questions to test yourself. {{ exams.length }} exams covered, {{ coming.length }} more on the way. One free sign-up opens every guide.</p>
</header>

<div class="gl-body" data-gl>
  <div class="gl-bar">
    <div class="gl-filters" role="toolbar" aria-label="Filter guides">
      <button type="button" class="gl-filter is-on" data-gl-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All <span>{{ exams.length + coming.length }}</span></button>
      {%- for v in vendors %}{% set n = 0 %}{% for e in exams %}{% if (e.vendor or "Claude") == v %}{% set n = n + 1 %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
      <button type="button" class="gl-filter" data-gl-filter="{{ v | slugify }}" aria-pressed="false">{{ v }} <span>{{ n }}</span></button>
      {%- endfor %}
      <button type="button" class="gl-filter" data-gl-filter="soon" aria-pressed="false">Coming soon <span>{{ coming.length }}</span></button>
    </div>
    <p class="gl-count" data-gl-count aria-live="polite"></p>
  </div>

  <div class="gl-grid">
    {%- for exam in exams %}
    {%- set g = bbLiveGuides | findBy("slug", exam.guide) %}
    {%- set pack = (brainbyte.practice | findBy("exam", exam.packExam)) if exam.packExam else "" %}
    <article class="gl-card" data-gl-tags="{{ (exam.vendor or 'Claude') | slugify }}">
      <div class="gl-top">
        <span class="gl-code">{{ exam.code }}</span>
        <span class="gl-vendor"><img src="{{ exam.logo or '/images/logos/claude.svg' }}" alt="" width="16" height="16" loading="lazy" />{{ exam.vendor or "Claude" }}</span>
      </div>
      {%- if exam.cover %}<img class="gl-thumb" src="{{ exam.cover }}" alt="" width="800" height="500" loading="lazy" />{% endif %}
      <div class="gl-inner">
      <h2 class="gl-name">{% if g %}<a class="gl-link" href="/guides/{{ exam.guide }}/">{{ exam.name }}</a>{% else %}{{ exam.name }}{% endif %}</h2>
      <p class="gl-facts">{{ exam.facts }}</p>
      {%- if g %}
      <ul class="gl-stats">
        <li><b>{{ g.domains | sumLength("lessons") }}</b> lessons</li>
        <li><b>{{ g.stats[2].n }}</b> traps</li>
        {%- if pack and pack.status == 'live' %}<li><b>{{ pack.count }}</b> practice Qs</li>{% elif g.stats[3] %}<li><b>{{ g.stats[3].n }}</b> {{ g.stats[3].label }}</li>{% endif %}
      </ul>
      {%- endif %}
      <div class="gl-actions">
        {% if g %}<span class="gl-go">Read guide <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>{% endif %}
        {% if pack and pack.status == 'live' %}<a class="gl-pack" href="{{ pack.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{% include "topmate-icon.njk" %}Practice ↗</a>{% else %}<span class="gl-soon">Practice soon</span>{% endif %}
      </div>
      </div>
    </article>
    {%- endfor %}
    {%- for t in coming %}
    <article class="gl-card gl-card-soon" data-gl-tags="soon">
      <div class="gl-top">
        <span class="gl-code gl-code-soon">Coming soon</span>
        <span class="gl-vendor"><img src="{{ t.logo }}" alt="" width="16" height="16" loading="lazy" />{{ t.cert.split(" · ")[0] }}</span>
      </div>
      {%- if t.cover %}<img class="gl-thumb" src="{{ t.cover }}" alt="" width="800" height="500" loading="lazy" />{% endif %}
      <div class="gl-inner">
      <h2 class="gl-name"><a class="gl-link" href="#join">{{ t.title }}</a></h2>
      <p class="gl-facts">{{ t.level }}{% if t.weeks %} · about {{ t.weeks }} weeks{% endif %}</p>
      <p class="gl-blurb">{{ t.pitch }}</p>
      <div class="gl-actions"><span class="gl-go">Join the waitlist <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></div>
      </div>
    </article>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>

  <div class="gl-join hub-glass hub-light" id="join">
    <div>
      <span class="hub-label">Hear first</span>
      <p class="gl-join-text">New guides and practice packs go to {{ site.newsletter.name }} subscribers first. {{ site.newsletter.tagline }}, a new issue {{ site.newsletter.cadence }}. Free.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      {% set nfId = 'guides' %}{% set nfClass = 'bg-gate-form' %}{% set nfBtnClass = 'pf-btn pf-btn-primary' %}{% include "newsletter-form.njk" %}
      <p class="hub-meta">Unsubscribe any time.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="hub-meta gl-fine">Independent study material, not affiliated with or endorsed by Anthropic or Google. Contains no actual exam questions.</p>
</div>
